<div class="l-content-wrapper" id="sprg250354">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="column">
        <p>Data on the short-term economic development in Germany are currently available on the <a class="RichTextExtLink ExternalLink" href="https://www.dashboard-konjunktur.de" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="External link Datenportal: Dashboard Konjunktur (Opens new window)">Economic Dashboard</a>, in the <a class="RichTextExtLink ExternalLink" href="https://genesis.destatis.de/datenbank/online?language=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="External link GENESIS-Online, statistical information system (Opens new window)">GENESIS-Online</a> database and on the Short-term indicators page. We wish to inform you that this last option, <strong>the Short-term indicators page, will not be updated from October 2026 and will be deactivated at the start of 2027. </strong>The data will continue to be available, however.</p>



<p><a class="RichTextIntLink Basepage" href="EN/Themes/Economy/Short-Term-Indicators/changes-in-provision.html" title="Changes in the provision of results for short-term indicators">MORE</a></p>

